### Uji API Praktikum ORM (ekstensi VS Code "REST Client": klik "Send Request")
### Jalankan dulu: php artisan migrate:fresh --seed && php artisan serve

@base = http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1

### 1. Daftar mahasiswa + jumlah surat -> 200
GET {{base}}/mahasiswa?q=andi
Accept: application/json

### 2. Tambah mahasiswa -> 201 (id = 23)
POST {{base}}/mahasiswa
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{"nim": "2301050", "nama": "Rina Wulandari", "prodi": "Sistem Informasi", "angkatan": 2023}

### 3. Validasi gagal -> 422
POST {{base}}/mahasiswa
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{"nim": "2201001", "nama": "", "angkatan": 1990}

### 4. Ubah sebagian data -> 200
PATCH {{base}}/mahasiswa/23
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{"prodi": "Teknik Informatika"}

### 5. Detail mahasiswa + surat + jenis surat (eager loading) -> 200
GET {{base}}/mahasiswa/1
Accept: application/json

### 6. Ajukan surat (transaksi: surat + riwayat) -> 201
POST {{base}}/surat
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{"mahasiswa_id": 23, "jenis_surat_id": 3, "keperluan": "Penelitian skripsi di Diskominfo."}

### 7. Ubah status -> 200
PATCH {{base}}/surat/23/status
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{"status": "diproses", "catatan": "Verifikasi BAAK"}

### 8. Aturan bisnis menolak (Selesai -> Diproses) -> 422
PATCH {{base}}/surat/1/status
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{"status": "diproses"}

### 9. Hapus mahasiswa (surat ikut terhapus / cascade) -> 204
DELETE {{base}}/mahasiswa/23
Accept: application/json

### 10. Surat milik mahasiswa yang dihapus -> 404
GET {{base}}/surat/23
Accept: application/json

### Bonus: filter surat per status + paginasi
GET {{base}}/surat?status=diproses&per_page=5
Accept: application/json
